EPYON PATHWAYS
PATCH & FEENIX: GUARDIANS OF GOOD AI

Episode 1: The Shortcut Machine

Theme:
Just because AI can do something doesn't mean it should.

Lesson:
Always verify information before sharing it.

--------------------------------------------------
CAST
--------------------------------------------------

PATCH
A curious rescue pup who loves helping others.

Strengths:
• Kind
• Loyal
• Brave

Weakness:
• Sometimes acts before thinking.

